> Question #1:  at what point do you decide:  ok, I'm switching to 
> kill-everything-to-boost-my-XP?

Never, really.  You'll hit XL:12 or so pretty easily without
deliberately trying to boost your XP.  Then you just need XL:14 for the
quest.  After that, I only raise levels if I absolutely need skill
slots.

> Question #2:  at what point do you decide:  ok, I'm powerful enough to 
> go on my quest?

Depends on the quest.  The Wizard or Valk quests can usually be done
immediately upon reaching sufficient XL.  The Monk, Healer, and Rogue
quests, for example, might need to wait for specific intrinsics or
items.

